Expose region key ledgers and derived boundary policies through the candidate graph

Preserve typed vertex output on rejection, validate returned policy UTF-8, and inventory unused grid and engineering definitions without evaluating unused geometry. Correct the existing Host negative-control anchor to the four-argument snapshot hash call. Tests: four new suites (14 derived policy source, 4 derived product, 4 grid definition product, 15 region key source); existing engineering sources 15->18, grid sources 8->11. Six affected suites discover 66 methods. Eleven portable checks passed, followed by the two changed UTF-8 boundary checks; native methods and controls remain UNRUN on this source. The earlier 72c focused red result is unchanged.
